---
import { Bell } from '@lucide/astro'
---

<section class="notice-band on-night" aria-labelledby="notice-title">
  <div class="wrap notice-band-grid">
    <div class="notice-band-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow eyebrow--night"><span class="dot"></span> Under-Notch Alerts &amp; Agenda</span>
      <h2 id="notice-title">The one alert that reaches you <em>mid-flow.</em></h2>
      <p>
        Corner toasts get ignored or steal keyboard focus. Whether it is a local task reminder, a
        Google Calendar event or an OpenCode approval alert, Hero Notch unfolds a quiet card directly
        beneath the collapsed bar for twelve seconds — over whatever app has focus.
      </p>

      <ul class="notice-points">
        <li><Bell size={13} /> Task title, time and Google Calendar agenda context — no popup to close.</li>
        <li>Never steals focus from your Markdown note, IDE or terminal.</li>
        <li>Auto-folds after 12 seconds while keeping macOS &amp; Windows notifications in sync.</li>
      </ul>

      <a class="link link--night" href="/help#reminder-missing">How reminders &amp; calendar alerts work</a>
    </div>

    <figure class="notice-figure">
      <img
        src="/screenshots/notice.png"
        width="1588"
        height="404"
        alt="The collapsed Hero Notch bar with a reminder card below it: “Reminder · Stand up and stretch, Today at 3:30 PM”."
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        style="filter: grayscale(1) contrast(1.08);"
      />
      <figcaption>Real app capture · collapsed bar and 12-second under-notch card</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>
